# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/data/texts.yml:730
msgid ""
"Attack +3 per point; Armor Class and party resistances 3 % of the guard per point; a chance to paralyse for 2 s"
msgstr ""
"Atak +3 za punkt; klasa pancerza i odporności drużyny 3 % gardy za punkt; szansa na sparaliżowanie na 2 s"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/data/texts.yml:732
#| msgid ""
msgid ""
"Attack +4 per point; Armor Class and party resistances 4 % of the guard per point; usable with Unarmed, paralysis lasts 4 s"
msgstr ""
"Atak +4 za punkt; klasa pancerza i odporności drużyny 4 % gardy za punkt; działa z walką wręcz, paraliż trwa 4 s"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/data/texts.yml:735
msgid ""
"Each point raises the damage of the sword, Armsmaster and special abilities by 2 % (never less than 1 per point). From Master, a sword in hand also adds Armor Class: the percent below of the sword's guard (it grows with the sword's power) for each point of skill, counted as if you had 10 more points.{guard_line}"
msgstr ""
