"Each point raises the damage of the spear, Armsmaster and special abilities by 2 % (never less than 1 per point). From Expert, a spear in hand also adds Armor Class: the percent below of the spear's guard (it grows with the spear's power) for each point of skill, counted as if you had 10 more points.{guard_line}"
